    "name": "Allay Therapeutics Content Oembed API",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": {
      "content": "The read-only content surface Allay Therapeutics exposes at https://www.allaytx.com/wp-json. Allay Therapeutics is a clinical-stage biopharmaceutical company in San Jose, California and Singapore developing ultra-sustained, non-opioid analgesic products for post-surgical pain management, led by the bupivacaine-based ATX-101 implant for total knee replacement. It runs no developer program and markets no product API. This document is an API Evangelist derivation of the WordPress `wp/v2` and `oembed/1.0` route index the site publishes at /wp-json/, restricted to the operations verified to return data anonymously on 2026-08-06. Every write route, the entire plugin-administration surface, and `/wp/v2/users` are deliberately excluded — see x-api-evangelist-provenance.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Allay Therapeutics\n Email: contact@allaytx.com",
      "type": "text/plain"
    }
  }
